function output = checked(lower,value)
arguments
lower (1,1) double = 0
value (1,1) double {mustBeFinite,mustBeGreaterThan(value,lower),mustBeInRange(value,- 1,1e2,'exclude-lower',"exclude-upper")} = lower + 1
end
arguments (Output)
output (1,1) double {mustBePositive(output)}
end
output = value;
end
